#ASSERT `Am I eligible for the home buyer concession` `1 Nov 2026` `a home` TRUE TRUE TRUE 17 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `1 Dec 2026` TRUE EQUALS `under the 2026 determination` (`not eligible` `a transferee is under the required age`)
#ASSERT `Am I eligible for the home buyer concession` `1 Nov 2026` `a home` TRUE TRUE TRUE 17 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `1 Dec 2026` TRUE EQUALS `under the 2026 determination` `eligible`
#ASSERT `Am I eligible for the home buyer concession` `1 Nov 2026` `a home` TRUE TRUE TRUE 18 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `1 Dec 2026` TRUE EQUALS `under the 2026 determination` `eligible`
-- s 5(2)-(3)(a): a company co-buyer; s 5(3)(b)-(d), (4): a trustee; s 6(1)(a): no equitable interest.
#ASSERT `Am I eligible for the home buyer concession` `1 Nov 2026` `a home` FALSE TRUE TRUE 35 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `1 Dec 2026` TRUE EQUALS `under the 2026 determination` (`not eligible` `a transferee is not an individual`)
#ASSERT `Am I eligible for the home buyer concession` `1 Nov 2026` `a home` TRUE FALSE TRUE 35 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `1 Dec 2026` TRUE EQUALS `under the 2026 determination` (`not eligible` `a transferee acquires other than in their personal capacity (as a trustee, a partner in a partnership or an agent)`)
#ASSERT `Am I eligible for the home buyer concession` `1 Nov 2026` `a home` TRUE TRUE FALSE 35 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `1 Dec 2026` TRUE EQUALS `under the 2026 determination` (`not eligible` `not every transferee acquires both a legal and an equitable interest`)
-- DI2026-155 Sch 1 has no age condition: a 17-year-old owner occupier gets Table 1.
