#ASSERT `How much duty do I pay` `an acquisition of an interest in a landholder, or another chapter 3 transaction` `1 Aug 2026` `a home` FALSE 480000 0 480000 `purchase` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE 30 FALSE `1 Aug 2026` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `none of these` 30 FALSE FALSE `no former home` `1 Aug 2026` `1 Aug 2026` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `not covered` `landholder duty and the other chapter 3 transactions are not encoded`
